# Frontend build-time config (Vite).
#
# Leave UNSET for the single-container Hostinger deploy and for local dev
# (requests go to same-origin /api, and Vite proxies /api -> localhost:4000 in dev).
#
# Set this ONLY when the frontend is hosted separately from the API (e.g. on Vercel).
# Use the API's ORIGIN (no /api, no trailing slash):
# VITE_API_URL=https://mu8xxwppbl1mmtgi5fluzooa.187.127.135.148.sslip.io
